---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Sailboat Retrospective" description="The weekly human ritual of the Tensor-to-Tenant course." activeNav="resources">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Sailboat Retrospective"
    title="The weekly human ritual"
    lead="The Sailboat turns a 108-week apprenticeship from a checklist into a navigable journey. Use it at the end of every week - keep answers short and concrete, and choose the next heading rather than writing a performance review."
  />

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:1rem">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- ASCII boat -->
      <pre>{`                 Rocks
           upcoming risks

Wind  →       [ Boat ]       →  Island
helpers       learner            capability

                 Anchor
             current drag`}</pre>

      <div class="callout">
        <strong>The four forces</strong>
        <p>
          The Island is your destination capability. The Wind is what helped progress - a concept,
          person, tool, habit, or environment. The Anchor is what slowed you down. The Rocks are the
          risks that could derail the next week.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="kicker" style="margin-top:2rem">Weekly template</div>
      <div class="card" style="padding:1.5rem">
        <div class="mono" style="font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:1rem">Week ____ - Sailboat Retro</div>

        <h3>Island / destination</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">What capability am I trying to reach this week or phase?</p>
        <div style="border-bottom:1px dashed var(--border);margin:1rem 0"></div>

        <h3>Wind</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">What helped progress? (Concept, person, tool, habit, or environment)</p>
        <div style="border-bottom:1px dashed var(--border);margin:1rem 0"></div>

        <h3>Anchor</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">What slowed me down?</p>
        <div style="border-bottom:1px dashed var(--border);margin:1rem 0"></div>

        <h3>Rocks</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">What could derail the next week?</p>
        <div style="border-bottom:1px dashed var(--border);margin:1rem 0"></div>

        <h3>Boat position</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">Choose one: Ahead · On track · Drifting</p>
        <div style="border-bottom:1px dashed var(--border);margin:1rem 0"></div>

        <h3>Next heading</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">What is the single most important adjustment for next week?</p>
        <div style="border-bottom:1px dashed var(--border);margin:1rem 0"></div>

        <h3>Course connection</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted)">
          Which layer did this week strengthen? Mathematics · Algorithms / Leetcode Darbar ·
          Engineering primitives · Distributed systems / System Design · ML systems · LLM systems ·
          Inference · Production platform · Staff judgment
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="callout callout--amber">
        <strong>One sentence I can explain out loud</strong>
        <p>
          Every weekly retro ends with the commitment to be able to explain one thing out loud, from
          memory, to a colleague. If you cannot, that is your next heading.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
